urn to main menu Arts & Humanities Navigation link in category Our faculties. Press escape key to return to main menu Law Navigation link in category Our faculties. Press escape key to return to main menu Nursing, Midwifery & Palliative Care Navigation link in category Our faculties. Press escape key to return to main menu Business Navigation link in category Our faculties. Press escape key to return to main menu Life Sciences & Medicine Navigation link in category Our faculties. Press escape key to return to main menu Psychiatry, Psychology & Neuroscience Navigation link in category Our faculties. Press escape key to return to main menu Natural, Mathematical & Engineering Sciences Navigation link in category Our faculties. Press escape key to return to main menu Dentistry, Oral & Craniofacial Sciences Navigation link in category Our faculties. Press escape key to return to main menu Social Sciences & Public Policy Navigation link in category Our faculties. Press escape key to return to main menu About Navigation category. Contains links. Press enter key to expand. About Navigation link in category About. Press escape key to return to main menu History Navigation link in category About. Press escape key to return to main menu Strategy Navigation link in category About. Press escape key to return to main menu Learning & Teaching Navigation link in category About. Press escape key to return to main menu Our People Navigation link in category About. Press escape key to return to main menu Work at King's Navigation link in category About. Press escape key to return to main menu Partnerships Navigation link in category About. Press escape key to return to main menu Governance, policies & procedures Navigation link in category About. Press escape key to return to main menu Professional & Support Services Navigation link in category About. Press escape key to return to main menu Diversity & Inclusion Navigation link in category About. Press escape key to return to main menu Financial information Navigation link in category About. Press escape key to return to main menu King’s Impact Navigation link in category About. Press escape key to return to main menu King's Venues Navigation link in category About. Press escape key to return to main menu Sustainability Navigation link in category About. Press escape key to return to main menu Students Staff Alumni Open search input Jobs at King’s College London Your career Navigation link How we recruit Navigation link Our benefits Navigation link Our culture Navigation link About King's Navigation link Jobs at King’s College London Search for jobs Search for jobs Find jobs A place to make a lasting impact King’s College London provides a dynamic habitat for individuals looking to expand their career prospects. Whether you are interested in research, teaching or professional services, King’s has a range of job and career opportunities available.\n\nWith its world-leading position in education and research as well as its commitment to service, King’s is dedicated to improving the lives of people around the globe while supporting individual growth through an inspiring work environment. As such, it’s no surprise that many top professionals, researchers, and scientists have chosen to develop their careers at King’s over the years – join them now and take your career to new heights! Browse jobs by category ​​​ Academic and teaching vacancies at King’s College London We believe in the power of education to create a better future. Professional and support services vacancies at King’s College London We enable the efficient operation and delivery of core services. Research vacancies at King’s College London We tackle unsolved problems and push the boundaries of human knowledge. View all current vacancies If you’re on the lookout for job opportunities at King’s, then our jobs search page is your one-stop destination to search for vacancies across all King’s campuses. We have an extensive list of current vacancies across various departments and roles at King’s.\n\nThe search page is designed to be user-friendly, allowing you to filter your search based on faculty, job category and other relevant criteria. View all current vacancies across King’s Discover new career opportunities in arts, business, sciences and healthcare Arts & Sciences job opportunities Advance discovery and innovation across arts and sciences. Nursing, Midwifery & Palliative Care job opportunities Advance practice in compassionate, person-centred healthcare. Current internal vacancies All our internal vacancies are published in HR digital services. King’s staff with access to HR digital services should apply by this route as the system will recognise you as a member of King’s. You don’t need to register a new account.\n\nFor internal candidates who do not have a HR digital services log on – all internal vacancies can be accessed via the external job board and will be clearly marked as internal. Affiliates and students without access to HR digital services should apply through the external King’s jobs website. Current internal vacancies Connect with King’s College London Study Degree courses Footer navigation link Postgraduate taught Footer navigation link Postgraduate research Footer navigation link International Footer navigation link Summer schools Footer navigation link Student experience Footer navigation link Information for New students Footer navigation link Current students Footer navigation link Staff Footer navigation link Alumni Footer navigation link Facilities Student services Footer navigation link Accommodation Footer navigation link Libraries & Collections Footer navigation link King’s IT Footer navigation link Academic Calendar Footer navigation link Discover King's News Centre Footer navigation link Events Footer navigation link Student's Union Footer navigation link Visit King's Footer navigation link Work at King's Footer navigation link King's community Footer navigation link 